		{"id":"ba0d28cbace35e85","type":"text","text":"|+ Session Recap\n\n+ The party went ahead with the plan but encountered a paladin with a grudge against Dodrick, after the fight they had completed the mission to kill two Aristocrats from Areti who were in Soleil for a diplomatic visit\n+ The party and Clown got separated in the chaos\n+ Tycho Teto sensed something flaring in his head telling him to go somewhere\n+ He lead them to a research facility within a mountain and encountered an evil ai who took over Teto's mind\n+ With the help of Ivory, the AI's control over Tycho was dispelled.","x":-1410,"y":-3840,"width":872,"height":847,"color":"#242bff"},
